@startuml
title RevenuePulse AI - Initial (pre-AI) account review workflow

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam swimlaneWidth 220
skinparam wrapWidth 220

|Sales Manager|
start
:Export / view account data\n(billing + CRM + product reports);
:Manually inspect revenue;\n:Manually inspect engagement;
:Manually inspect activity and\nsupport history;
:Identify risky accounts\n(judgement, recency bias,\nspreadsheet filters);
if (Which accounts need attention?) then (personal judgement)
  :Decide outreach or no action;
else (not reviewed this quarter)
  :Account left unreviewed;
endif
:Record follow-up in notes\nor CRM task;
stop

note right of |Sales Manager|
  No prioritisation model.
  No consistent definition of "material decline".
  Review effort follows recency and familiarity.
  A decline is often noticed after it appears in revenue reporting.
end note

@enduml
